   "body_markdown": "Just a note: `shim_thread` objects were leaked for \"normal\" threads. Even though these threads went through cleanup in LibOS's `thread_exit()` and their stacks were removed in PAL's `DkThreadExit()`, their `shim_thread`s still leaked.\r\n\r\nMy PR https://github.com/oscarlab/graphene/pull/1199 removes this leak."
